Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): Memory Stream + Architecture area view
 (ce75d317, 83690fd4)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Next two green-lit v6-brief items (rest still paused), stacked on #344.

Memory (ce75d317) — cut the work-folder grid (it "looked like tasks"); build ONE
reverse-chronological Memory Stream:
- Typed entries (glyph · one-line text · timestamp · provenance chips: area/source/
  status), banded (dated decisions → undated headline decisions).
- Click an entry → its thread (related decisions in the same architecture area) —
  the degrade path for the temporal graph until Graphiti (c7971150) is wired; NO
  empty full-width graph pane.
- Pinned Canon rail: accepted-decisions count + architecture docs.
- Honest SEAMs: forge recall is empty; the `.remember` now/today/recent/archive
  rotation is user-global and mixes projects, so it is deliberately NOT baked into
  this project stream (would leak cross-project memory) — a slug-scoped ingestor
  merges it later (c7971150). Empty-state falls back to decisions.

Architecture (83690fd4) — rename Decisions → Architecture; replace the flat/Kanban
board with architecture **areas as folder-nodes**:
- Group the 27 decisions by the top segment of their dotted/dashed `component`
  (authority.local.storage → authority; agent-interface.parity → agent) → 12 areas.
- Open an area → its decisions (status glyph + source/component tags); click one →
  detail + an area thread. Architecture-docs index below. Relations = SEAM (56461780).
- Route id decisions → architecture (`#/architecture`); the `#/decision/:id` detail
  route is unchanged. Nav/counts/icon updated.

Both: dark-default, mono skin, entity routing (rows/cards are links), one card atom.
Interaction-verified (area expand → 9 decisions, decision→thread(8), stream 27
entries in bands, canon=27 accepted, no empty graph pane, filter→11). ESLint clean,
12 tests pass. Screenshots: v6-memory-stream.png, v6-architecture.png.

Paused (not in PR): plans-as-workfolders (f4a421d7). Refs ce75d317, 83690fd4.

